    "head_commit_message": "chore(tools): tick_phases splits the shuffle into its parts\n\nShufflePhases mirrors FormationShuffle.step with a lap at each part:\nmoves under way, planning (who stands where, front-first order, the\nfree front places), each unit's tries (a free front place, passing\nthrough) and beginning a move. tick_phases' own check still holds, so\nthe mirror can't drift unnoticed. The shuffle took 160 ms of a 510 ms\ntick at four stacks of 1,024; this shows where.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01E3rJWSqvkcCzMoGnLiZBk1",
